# CONVENTIONS — {{PROJECT}}

Opinionated rules for this codebase. Durable policy lives in `CLAUDE.md`;
traps in [GOTCHAS.md](GOTCHAS.md). When the owner states an always/never rule
it lands here in the same session — and as a red test where the stack allows
(escalation path: [references/engineering-principles.md](references/engineering-principles.md)).

## Process (kit-standard)

- Branch names: `<type>/<slug>` with `<type>` from `branch_types` in
  `.claude/kit.json`. Protected branches are never created, never merged into,
  never pushed to by Claude — owner only.
- Every app change → one line in `.memory/CHANGELOG.md` (the Stop gate holds
  the session until it moves).
- Decisions via `/decide`; observations → ISSUES; speculation → IDEAS;
  unverifiable changes → VERIFY with acceptance criteria.
- No secrets in the repo; `.env*` and lockfiles are never hand-edited.

